# Shashank Sharma - Personal Academic Website

This repository contains the source code for my personal academic website, hosted at [https://shashank879.github.io](https://shashank879.github.io).

## About

I am a Ph.D. candidate in Computer Science at the University of Bath, working on automated goal-oriented reinforcement learning agents. This website showcases my research, publications, and professional background.

## Website Structure

- `index.html` - Main homepage with research overview and publications
- Additional pages and resources may be added over time

## Local Development

To run this website locally:

1. Clone this repository
2. Open `index.html` in your web browser
3. Or serve it using a simple HTTP server:
   ```bash
   python -m http.server 8000
   ```
   Then visit `http://localhost:8000`

## Updates

The website is automatically updated whenever changes are pushed to the main branch, thanks to GitHub Pages.

